{
  "title": { "zh": "逆用实例框" },
  "tray": "machine",
  "intro": [
    {
      "t": {
        "zh": "<part-ref to=\"part:exE\"></part-ref>写成规则是 ⟦∃x. ?P(x); ⋀x. ⟦?P(x)⟧ ⟹ ?C⟧ ⟹ ?C。它也是消去规则：第一条前提对上一条「存在」，第二条前提前面的 ⋀x 让新目标多出一样东西 a，以及关于它的已知。"
      }
    }
  ],
  "tasks": [
    {
      "id": "r-exE",
      "kind": "machine",
      "want": "proved",
      "inputs": [{ "name": "in", "label": { "zh": "目标" } }],
      "tests": [
        { "goal": "Pigs", "hyps": ["∃x. Human(x) ∧ ¬Human(x)"] },
        { "goal": "Moon", "hyps": ["∃y. ¬Bird(y) ∧ Bird(y)"] }
      ],
      "brief": { "zh": "设计一个证明助手，证完每一个目标。" },
      "hint": [
        { "zh": "已知自相矛盾，矛盾在它说存在的那样东西身上。" },
        {
          "zh": "<part-ref to=\"lemma:erule\"></part-ref>接上<part-ref to=\"part:exE\"></part-ref>，对上「存在」那条已知。"
        }
      ],
      "solution": [
        "c0r0 = botE()",
        "c1r0 = exE()",
        "c2r0 = andE[use=[conjE]]()",
        "c3r0 = mp[use=[mp]]()",
        "c0 = rule(in, c0r0)",
        "c1 = erule(c0, c1r0)",
        "c2 = erule(c1, c2r0)",
        "c3 = erule(c2, c3r0)",
        "c4 = assumption(c3)",
        "out <- c4"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
